{title: Highway To Heaven}
{key: C}

{comment: Chorus}
[C]It's a [F]highway to [C]heaven
[G]None can walk up there
[C]But the purest heart
It's a [F]highway to [C]heaven
I'm walking up the [G]King's [C]highway

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]There's joy in knowing
With Him I'm going
Walking up the King's [G]highway
My load is lighter
My pathway brighter
Walking up the King's [C]highway

{comment: Verse 2}
[C]If you're not walking
Start while I'm talking
Walking up the King's [G]highway
You'll find a blessing
You'll be possessing
Walking up the King's [C]highway
